OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hub for school leavers
OL,4,Awith complex needs opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA specialist centre to help young
OL,7,Fpeople with severe learning
OL,8,Fdisabilities who have left formal
OL,9,Feducation has officially opened in
OL,10,FKnowsley.
OL,12,FElliot's Haven is named after
OL,13,F20-year-old Elliott McLeod, from
OL,14,FKnowsley, who has a rare complex
OL,15,Fcondition called Leigh's Disease, which
OL,16,Fmeans he must be kept alive by a
OL,17,Fventilator and requires 24 hour care.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
