OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hub for school leavers
OL,4,Awith complex needs opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe centre, at Southdene Community
OL,7,FCentre in Kirkby, has been set up by
OL,8,FElliot's mother Danielle, who said she
OL,9,Fwanted to create an ongoing community
OL,10,Fafter Elliot left school last year.
OL,12,FShe said continuity and familiarity was
OL,13,F"very important for individuals with
OL,14,Fcomplex needs".
